{"77dbfa29-8ef0-446d-82cc-1b4de878dd90":{"id":"77dbfa29-8ef0-446d-82cc-1b4de878dd90","title":"Sokushi Cheat ga Saikyou Sugite, Isekai no Yatsura ga Marude Aite ni Naranai ndesu ga. -ΑΩ-","altTitle":"The Other World Doesn’t Stand a Chance Against the Power of Instant Death. -ΑΩ-","description":"Growth cheats? Infinite magic power? The ability to utilize all archetypes? What’s the point if instant death ends everything with a single attack? \n \nAwaking to absolute chaos and carnage while on a school trip, Yogiri Takatou discovers that everyone in his class has been transported to another world!\n\nHe had somehow managed to sleep through the entire ordeal himself, missing out on the Gift — powers bestowed upon the others by a mysterious Sage who appeared to transport them. Even worse, he and another classmate were ruthlessly abandoned by their friends, left as bait to distract a nearby dragon. Although not terribly bothered by the thought of dying, he reluctantly decides to protect his lone companion. After all, a lowly Level 1000 monster doesn't stand a chance against his secret power to invoke Instant Death with a single thought!\n\nIf he can stay awake long enough to bother using it, that is...","year":2018,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Comedy","Adventure","Isekai","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/77dbfa29-8ef0-446d-82cc-1b4de878dd90/ede50d76-a30c-40a1-a6f0-d562983b57f1.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["pt-br","vi","en","id","fr","es-la","ru","tr"],"lane":"manga","rating":7.75,"follows":76437,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:05:15.312Z","chapters":[{"id":"831cb7a3-136d-4c46-9d1d-4680e315056a","number":"54","volume":"10","title":null,"lang":"id","pages":25,"createdAt":"2024-08-20T19:33:22+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"97270185-b5c0-48bc-bee4-3c7cbd87f44c","number":"49","volume":"10","title":null,"lang":"id","pages":26,"createdAt":"2024-02-05T11:00:58+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"3